  sopSections:
  - title: Phases 1 - 4
    body: "Open the Equipment Box and carry one item at a time.  Rack01: install
      the following:\nPDU1 (Rear - U35 - U38)\nAN-1  (Front - U35 - U38)\nCN-1 (Front
      - U30 - U34)\nIT2 (Front - U3 - U8)\n\nRack02: install the following:\nPDU2
      (Rear - U35 - U38)\nAN-2 (Front - U35 - U38)\n\nDesks: \nDesktop (IT1) at IT
      Desk\nDesktop PC (Reception1) and Printer (Reception2) at Reception Desk\nDesktop
      PC (Data1) at Office 1 Desk\nDesktop PC (Data2) and Printer (Data3) at Office
      2 Desk."
  - title: Phases 5 - 8
    body: Physical cabling and carrier handoff instructions will be added after the
      placement workflow is validated.
  - title: Phases 9 - 15
    body: Layer 2 switch hardening, VLAN, switchport, trunk, and verification instructions
      will be added in a later pass.
  - title: Phases 16 - 19
    body: Router hardening, router-on-a-stick, WAN/default route, and end-to-end
      verification instructions will be added in a later pass.
  - title: Phases 20 - 22
    body: Wireless AP installation, browser configuration, and wireless verification
      instructions will be added in a later pass.
